e_opt_in_level` with `requiredLevel` to request higher access, or without `requiredLevel` when the user asks to review or change the setting. Every call requires approval through the opt-in request card, even when the organization already has the requested level. If the requested level is already satisfied, the input transform removes `requiredLevel` and treats the call as a review request; `levelWhenAsked` records the organization's level when the call was made.","+The model can call `update_opt_in_level` with `requiredLevel` to request higher access, or without `requiredLevel` when the user asks to review or change the setting. Every call requires approval through the opt-in request card, even when the organization already has the requested level. If the requested level is already satisfied, the contract's `createInputSchema` transform removes `requiredLevel` and treats the call as a review request; `levelWhenAsked` records the organization's level when the call was made."," "," On platform, the endpoint resolves organization access and `getTools` includes platform tools when an access token is available. It also registers the opt-in request tool. Self-hosted requests use the `schema` level and fallback tools instead of the platform tool set. Check [getTools](./tools/index.ts) and [generate-v4](../../pages/api/ai/sql/generate-v4.ts) when changing either environment."," "],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/lib/ai/tool-filter.test.ts","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ import {","   TOOL_CATEGORIES,","   TOOL_CATEGORY_MAP,","   toolSetValidationSchema,","+  withoutApprovalTools,"," } from './tool-filter'"," import { contract as createNotebookContract } from './tools/create-notebook'"," import { contract as deleteNotebookContract } from './tools/delete-notebook'","@@ -354,3 +355,20 @@ describe('toolSetValidationSchema', () => {","     expect(incompleteValidationResult.success).toBe(true) // Should still pass as we allow subsets","   })"," })"